  Collapsed --> Expanded: See all
  Expanded --> Collapsed: Show less
  Collapsed --> Collapsed: Current card stays visible
  Collapsed --> Collapsed: Pending review keeps its prior placement
  Collapsed --> Collapsed: Refresh replaces parsed items
  Expanded --> Expanded: Refresh preserves disclosure
  Collapsed --> Collapsed: Central midnight regroups dated tasks
  Expanded --> Expanded: Central midnight regroups dated tasks
  Collapsed --> Cleared: Session ends or view unmounts
  Expanded --> Cleared: Session ends or view unmounts
  Cleared --> [*]: Clock timer removed
